<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Grinacon lifts half year share, div.</title>
<headline>Grinacon lifts half year share, div.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year ended December 31</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>Pre-excep shr, attrib (cts)  38.4 vs 24.1</p>
<p>Post-excep shr, attrib (cts) 42.7 vs 24.1</p>
<p>    Div (cts)		 7.0	   vs 6.0</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		   23.35	 vs 12.59</p>
<p>    Tax			 7.30	  vs 3.90</p>
<p>    Interest paid	   3.96	  vs 7.76</p>
<p>    Interest received     6.03	  vs 3.34</p>
<p>    Turnover		  1,088.70    vs 910.95</p>
<p>Div payable April 11</p>
<p>on register March 7</p>
<p>Full name: Grinaker Construction Ltd (Industrial-building, construction, allied)</p>
<p>    Share of associates'  0.39	  vs 0.05</p>
<p>    Exceptional items     1.61 gain   vs nil</p>
<p>NOTE - The firm said in a statement that, taking into account an increase in the number of shares in issue, it anticipated earnings per share in the current financial year would show real growth.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
